,"rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T18:10:27-07:00","id":856120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=856081#post856081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dave's story is absolute gold, and one of the clearest statements about how to read Beast cosmologically you'll ever find-as well as a stirring reason why the 'lesson' culture has potency.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seconded. Premeditation was all-around great, and it presented the questions inherent to the cosmology of Beasts and their Lessons in a very strong way.<br /> <br /> So far, I've also really liked Family Reunion and Bigger Bites*, not only in spite of but also because of how they made my heart hurt.<br /> <br /> (Damn you Arc, for making me feel like that! ( \u2267\u0414\u2266))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 03-30-2016, 09:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T18:13:04-07:00","id":856122,"title":"","content":"I would apologize, but that's what I was going for.<br /> <br /> This is what happens when you let monomyth take over, even if you're the hero. Someone has to be Odin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T18:58:01-07:00","id":856152,"title":"","content":"That feeling when Dave wants to see people mad about including a Changing Breed in his Beast story, but you actually really like it.<br /> <br /> I'd be down for a 2e version of the Bastet that gets away from the mechanics in Changing Breeds, honestly. The Supernatural Merit for Skinchangers was a savvy way for Dark Eras to convert them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T19:00:17-07:00","id":856155,"title":"","content":"Truth be told, I had no idea what the 'cat' was the first time I read it. I just assumed weirdness until he explained how he had gone mad with authorial power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T03:10:08-07:00","id":856364,"title":"","content":"Just finished &quot;It Gets Easier&quot;. It was amazing. Kudos to the author - I feel given how Beast is a new line, these fictions will help shaping up its setting a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T03:26:35-07:00","id":856367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=856152#post856152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That feeling when Dave wants to see people mad about including a Changing Breed in his Beast story, but you actually really like it.<br /> <br /> I'd be down for a 2e version of the Bastet that gets away from the mechanics in Changing Breeds, honestly. The Supernatural Merit for Skinchangers was a savvy way for Dark Eras to convert them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I'd totally Develop a unified Changing Breeds / Skinchangers / Those guys from War Against The Pure book for 2e if Rich and our Swedish Masters would allow one. I pushed for the Gudthabak to be in Dark Eras, too. I just like weird shapechangers.<br /> <br /> Najat is a Bastet, but not from one of the groups in Changing Breeds - she was based on the (semi-feral and extremely numerous) street cats of Marracech, which is one of those things that's been rattling around in my writer/storyteller brain for years waiting for an excuse to use it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T07:16:23-07:00","id":856453,"title":"","content":"Just finished reading the anthology. Lots of really cool stuff in there that's giving me more ideas how to play/run Beast. <br /> <br /> Also, your name is quite the mouthful, Arc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T07:51:40-07:00","id":856472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=856453#post856453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just finished reading the anthology. Lots of really cool stuff in there that's giving me more ideas how to play/run Beast.<br /> <br /> Also, your name is quite the mouthful, Arc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Of all the feedback I expected both with delight and dread, that was not quite what I expected.<br /> <br /> But hey, here I am, named as kings, que the Queen song. My name is awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T14:23:51-07:00","id":856717,"title":"","content":"Mdr.<br /> <br /> In all honesty, I liked your story. It was cool to see the ripples of the Incarnate Inheritance, and the implications it can have on Begotten society.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T20:43:52-07:00","id":856912,"title":"","content":"&quot;The best murders are premeditated.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;...Goetia with delusions of grandeur.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> An excellent Beast story with a nice big helping of crossover Mage-y goodness.<br /> <br /> As a Mage fan, I hope we see Hal again. He's just so....Mastigos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","user":"branford","date":". 03-31-2016, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T23:43:39-07:00","id":856982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=856367#post856367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, I'd totally Develop a unified Changing Breeds / Skinchangers / Those guys from War Against The Pure book for 2e if Rich and our Swedish Masters would allow one. I pushed for the Gudthabak to be in Dark Eras, too. I just like weird shapechangers.<br /> <br /> Najat is a Bastet, but not from one of the groups in Changing Breeds - she was based on the (semi-feral and extremely numerous) street cats of Marracech, which is one of those things that's been rattling around in my writer/storyteller brain for years waiting for an excuse to use it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh gods yes. Please.<br /> <br /> Is anyone else interested? Would it be worth it to start a petition-name-list-thingy to prove to the powers that be that there is interest in such a thing?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T08:38:22-07:00","id":857146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=856122#post856122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would apologize, but that's what I was going for.<br /> <br /> This is what happens when you let monomyth take over, even if you're the hero. Someone has to be Odin.</div> </div> </div> </div>I squeed the whole time i read Bigger Bites. because TWO BEASTS IN LOVE,a Vampire who spent years helping the woman he loved despite her not even knowing who he is,the tragic bits at the end!<br /> Why sir,the hopeless romantic in me thanks you","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T11:48:45-07:00","id":857219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=857146#post857146\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I squeed the whole time i read Bigger Bites. because TWO BEASTS IN LOVE,a Vampire who spent years helping the woman he loved despite her not even knowing who he is,the tragic bits at the end!<br /> Why sir,the hopeless romantic in me thanks you</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a little wierded out at some of the responses on the vampire elsewhere. Kid's been stalking Robin for years, and has never once made an attempt to be forward, but does occasional little things for her and thinks that warrants an over-inflating of his importance in her life. Kid's an absolute creeper, but people seem to like him.<br /> <br /> But then again, considering I only barely mention him once before, I'll take any love for the little creep. I honestly expected the people who have commented on him so far to just stop and ask &quot;Okay, where did this asshole even come from?&quot;<br /> <br /> So, beyond that, thank you very much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm also a sucker for romances, tragic or otherwise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T12:17:00-07:00","id":857230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/856076-beast-anthology?p=857219#post857219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a little wierded out at some of the responses on the vampire elsewhere. Kid's been stalking Robin for years, and has never once made an attempt to be forward, but does occasional little things for her and thinks that warrants an over-inflating of his importance in her life. Kid's an absolute creeper, but people seem to like him.<br /> <br /> But then again, considering I only barely mention him once before, I'll take any love for the little creep. I honestly expected the people who have commented on him so far to just stop and ask &quot;Okay, where did this asshole even come from?&quot;<br /> <br /> So, beyond that, thank you very much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm also a sucker for romances, tragic or otherwise.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did wonder that, but vampires are known for being stealthy and subtle sons of a bitch with strange obsessions (Touchstone and otherwise). Realizing one was stalking a supernatural being out of some weird form of attraction isn't really out of character for any of them, so I shrugged and went on.<br /> <br /> Also, yeah. That story was a wonderful explanation of what happens when &quot;Beast&quot; really does become the flipside of &quot;Hero&quot;-nothing but obsession, obsession which devours more than any Horror could hope to alone.<br /> <br /> This book also redeemed Beast's fluff for me; it feels like every story takes one of my hang-ups and goes &quot;You know what, you're right to wonder that. Here's how it works in the game.&quot; I especially liked the portrayal of more characterized Heroes, the full examination of the Bright Dream and the Primordial, and how they really are truly alike in most ways-it's just that it's Beasts who are able to see the strings. Felt really sorry for Mary, and was actually rooting for Kelly there, for Stephanie's sake (&quot;And so, la Corazon died as she destroyed-lost in illusion&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\